(3. Time off) Tj
T*
(Full-time employees get 25 days of paid time off per year.) Tj
T*
(Up to 5 unused days carry over into the next year.) Tj
T*
(Sick leave is separate from paid time off and has no fixed limit.) Tj
T*
(Request time off at least two weeks ahead for absences over three days.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(4. Parental leave) Tj
T*
(Primary caregivers get 16 weeks of fully paid leave.) Tj
T*
(Secondary caregivers get 6 weeks of fully paid leave.) Tj
T*
ET
endstream
