(5. Expenses) Tj
T*
(Submit expense claims within 30 days of the purchase.) Tj
T*
(Attach a receipt for any expense over $25.) Tj
T*
(Meals while travelling are covered up to $60 per day.) Tj
T*
(Book economy class for flights under six hours.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(6. Security) Tj
T*
(Laptops must use full-disk encryption and a screen lock.) Tj
T*
(Never upload customer documents to public AI tools.) Tj
T*
(Report lost devices or suspected incidents to security@driftwood.example) Tj
T*
(within one hour.) Tj
T*
